@startuml
title SEQUENCE - TÍNH TRANSPARENCY SCORE

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 58
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantFontSize 15
  ActorFontSize 15
  ArrowFontSize 14
  ParticipantPadding 42
  BoxPadding 18
  MessageAlign center
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7C93
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
}
autonumber

actor "Khách truy cập" as Visitor
participant ScoreController
participant "TransparencyScore\nService" as ScoreService
participant RestaurantService
participant Redis
database PostgreSQL

Visitor -> ScoreController: GET /api/v1/restaurants/{restaurantId}/\ntransparency-score
ScoreController -> ScoreService: getScore(restaurantId, currentUserId)
ScoreService -> RestaurantService: requireViewableRestaurant(restaurantId, currentUserId)
RestaurantService -> PostgreSQL: Tìm restaurant có thể xem

alt Không tồn tại hoặc HIDDEN với public
  PostgreSQL --> RestaurantService: Không thể xem
  RestaurantService --> ScoreService: Not Found
  ScoreService --> ScoreController: Not Found
  ScoreController --> Visitor: 404 Not Found
else Có thể xem
  PostgreSQL --> RestaurantService: Restaurant có thể xem
  RestaurantService --> ScoreService: Restaurant
  ScoreService -> Redis: GET score cache
  alt Cache hợp lệ
    Redis --> ScoreService: ScoreResponse
  else Cache miss, corrupt hoặc Redis down
    ScoreService -> RestaurantService: requireViewableRestaurantForUpdate(restaurantId, currentUserId)
    RestaurantService -> PostgreSQL: Lock row restaurant
    PostgreSQL --> RestaurantService: Restaurant đã khóa
    RestaurantService --> ScoreService: Restaurant
    ScoreService -> Redis: GET score cache lần hai
    alt Cache lần hai hợp lệ
      Redis --> ScoreService: ScoreResponse
    else Vẫn miss, corrupt hoặc Redis down
      ScoreService -> PostgreSQL: Đọc dữ liệu ACTIVE
      PostgreSQL --> ScoreService: Source + video + proof
      ScoreService -> ScoreService: Tính Completeness + Freshness
      ScoreService -> Redis: SET cache với dynamic TTL\n(best-effort)
    end
  end
  ScoreService --> ScoreController: Score từ 0 đến 100
  ScoreController --> Visitor: 200 OK + ScoreResponse
end

note over ScoreService, Redis
  PostgreSQL là nguồn dữ liệu chính.
  Lỗi Redis không làm rollback nghiệp vụ.
end note
@enduml
